  "body": "## Summary\r\nReplaces numeric character references (&#x...; and &#...;) with their Unicode equivalents for better readability and editability of the source code.\r\n\r\n## Changes\r\n- ✅ Decoded hex entities (&#x...;) to Unicode characters\r\n- ✅ Decoded decimal entities (&#...;) to Unicode characters  \r\n- ✅ Preserved control characters (U+0000-U+001F, U+007F-U+009F) as entities\r\n- ✅ Preserved invisible formatting characters (zero-width spaces, etc.) as entities\r\n- ✅ Verified all files are UTF-8 encoded\r\n\r\n## Examples\r\n\r\nBefore:\r\n```html\r\n<cite lang=\"sh\">&#x0426;&#x0440;&#x043d;&#x0430; &#x043c;&#x0430;&#x0447;&#x043a;&#x0430;</cite>\r\n```\r\n\r\nAfter:\r\n```html\r\n<cite lang=\"sh\">Црна мачка</cite>\r\n```\r\n\r\n## Methodology\r\nUsed a Python script to systematically process all HTML files while:\r\n- Detecting numeric character references\r\n- Checking if characters should remain encoded (control/invisible chars)\r\n- Converting safe characters to Unicode\r\n- Preserving UTF-8 encoding throughout\r\n\r\n## Testing\r\n- [x] Ran dry-run to preview changes\r\n- [x] Reviewed all diffs manually\r\n- [x] Verified UTF-8 encoding\r\n- [ ] Build tested (if applicable)\r\n\r\nFixes #3683",
